WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.680
Arthur, does it help have someone to talk to?

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:15.160
My mother always tells me

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.780
to smile and put on a happy face.

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.740
She told me I had a purpose

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.760
to bring laughter and joy to the world.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:32.500
Stop them!

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:38.860
Is it just me

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.500
Or is it getting crazier out there?

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.100
♪Smile

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:49.560
♪though your heart is aching

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:51.200
♪Smile

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.800
♪even though it's breaking

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:59.440
♪When there are clouds in the sky

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:01.560
♪you'll get by

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:02.540
What?

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.540
♪If you smile

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.760
♪through your fear and sorrow

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:09.640
♪Smile

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:12.320
♪and maybe tomorrow

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:18.640
Ahahahaha....

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:20.880
What's so funny?

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:22.880
Freak!

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:33.640
Gotham's lost its way.

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:39.000
What kind of coward would do something that cold-blooded?

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:42.860
Someone who hides behind a mask.

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:53.440
I used to think that my life was a tragedy.

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:00.920
But now I realize

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:04.780
it's a comedy.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:22.620
If you just smile, ...

